summary: Open saved whymark reviews or compare staged, unstaged, all-working,
  branch and commit changes inside VS Code. The bundled custom editor reuses
  the review UI without a server. Source edits are hash-checked, undoable
  editor changes and never change the index. New comparisons retain
  explanation stubs, and imported verification is not silently trusted. The
  VSIX is installable locally; platform and test limitations are recorded in
  the delivery evidence.
